  "method": "Pearson correlation between the modelled equilibrium field and ECOSTRESS L2T LSTE v002, per ward per scene, at the sensor's native 70 m. Both fields centred on their own ward mean first, so this measures PATTERN only \u2014 ward-mean error is reported separately by measure-accuracy.py.",
